{"3973660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guns of Salvation", "steam_appid": 3973660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the realm of darkness in this gothic Metroidvania where every domain embodies one of the Seven Deadly Sins. Explore a sprawling world of ruined cathedrals, cursed caverns, and towering castles as you hunt through the domains of demons who have captured Heaven’s cherubs. Armed to the teeth with Sci Fi weapons, a melodramatic determination, and the guidance of a mysterious angel, you’ll uncover secrets, battle grotesque monsters, and confront bosses born from sin itself. Nonlinear exploration, challenging combat, and atmospheric storytelling collide in a journey where failure is inevitable—but persistence carves the path to redemption.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the realm of darkness in this gothic Metroidvania where every domain embodies one of the Seven Deadly Sins. Explore a sprawling world of ruined cathedrals, cursed caverns, and towering castles as you hunt through the domains of demons who have captured Heaven’s cherubs. Armed to the teeth with Sci Fi weapons, a melodramatic determination, and the guidance of a mysterious angel, you’ll uncover secrets, battle grotesque monsters, and confront bosses born from sin itself. Nonlinear exploration, challenging combat, and atmospheric storytelling collide in a journey where failure is inevitable—but persistence carves the path to redemption.</p>", "short_description": "A dark Metroidvania where failure is eternal… and redemption is earned in blood. DEMO available now!!!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973660/614073b52145e0e7364834daf14e5ad1f941d6fb/header.jpg?t=1778526233", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste